lines:
We humans live alongside Pokémon,
at times as friendly playmates, and{be00}
at times as cooperative workmates.{be01}
And sometimes, we band together
and battle others like us.{be01}
But despite our closeness, we don’t
know everything about Pokémon.{be01}
In fact, there are many, many
secrets surrounding Pokémon.{be01}
To unravel Pokémon mysteries,
I’ve been undertaking research.{be00}
That’s what I do.{be01}

……原来如此！{be01}
你就是即将搬到
未白镇来的{0100:0}啊！{be00}
我知道了！{be01}

Before you go, I have seven quick
questions for you.{be01}
You can't change your answers
once your adventure begins,{be00}
so think them over carefully.{be01}
First: some researchers now say
Pokémon like Ralts and Marill{be00}
belong to a brand-new type:
the Fairy type!{be01}
Would you like to meet the
Fairy type on your adventure?{be01}

Second, about moves...{be01}
Nowadays, every move is either
physical or special on its own.{be01}
But some old-school Trainers say a
move's type decides that:{be00}
Fire, Water, Grass, Electric, Ice,{be00}
Psychic, Dragon and Dark moves are{be00}
special, and the others physical.{be01}
Should each move keep its own
physical or special nature?{be01}

Third... the music!
Every region has its own songs.{be01}
Would you like to hear Hoenn's
music on your journey, or Unova's?{be01}

Fourth... how everyone looks!{be01}
Would you like to see people the way
they looked in Hoenn long ago,{be00}
or in Unova's newer style?{be01}

Fifth... the seasons!{be01}
Here in Hoenn, it's summer all
year round.{be01}
Would you like the seasons to change
with the months instead?{be01}

Sixth... the Exp. Share!{be01}
It shares Exp. Points with your
whole team, even the Pokémon{be00}
that didn't battle.{be01}
You can turn it on or off from
your Bag whenever you like.{be01}
Would you like to start your
journey with an Exp. Share?{be01}
